#: e540b00b383d40a5bcabd43369301be6
msgid ""
"GPIO 82 controls the VTX BEC output to pins marked \"12V\" and is included "
"on the HD VTX connector. Setting this GPIO low removes voltage supply to "
"this pin/pad. By default RELAY3 is configured to control this pin and sets "
"the GPIO high."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 82 控制 VTX BEC 输出到标记为「12V」的引脚，并包含在 HD VTX 连接器上。将此 GPIO "
"设置为低电平会切断该引脚/焊盘的电源。默认情况下，RELAY3 配置为控制此引脚，并将 GPIO 设置为高电平。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixh743.rst:89 2ff8c76cda9349ba857ccdb05198e607
